1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:11,400
Reading the Earth's Main Ecosystems Simon is reading an article about the three main ecosystems on Earth.

2
00:00:11,400 --> 00:00:14,255
Here is the article.

3
00:00:14,255 --> 00:00:26,130
The Big Three – Oceans, Wetlands and Forests An ecosystem includes all the living and non-living things in an area.

4
00:00:26,130 --> 00:00:30,630
It can be small like a pond, or large like a grassland.

5
00:00:30,630 --> 00:00:35,610
Each ecosystem helps keep the balance of nature.

6
00:00:35,610 --> 00:00:40,190
The ocean is a very large ecosystem on Earth.

7
00:00:40,190 --> 00:00:49,520
It covers about 71% of the Earth's surface and produces about 70% of the Earth's oxygen.

8
00:00:49,520 --> 00:00:53,210
The ocean holds plenty of salt water.

9
00:00:53,210 --> 00:00:55,750
Some of the water rises to the sky.

10
00:00:55,750 --> 00:01:02,030
Later, it falls onto the land as rain and then returns to the ocean.

11
00:01:02,030 --> 00:01:08,740
This goes on and on, so the ocean is just like the heart of the Earth.

12
00:01:08,740 --> 00:01:14,560
Wetlands only cover about 6% of the Earth's land area.

13
00:01:14,560 --> 00:01:20,870
However, they are home to about 40% of all the types of plants and animals.

14
00:01:20,870 --> 00:01:26,890
Plants in wetlands help get rid of pollution and make the water clean.

15
00:01:26,890 --> 00:01:30,440
Wetlands can also help prevent floods.

16
00:01:30,440 --> 00:01:36,020
During heavy rains, wetlands store water like huge sponges.

17
00:01:36,020 --> 00:01:40,750
This way, they act like the kidneys of the Earth.

18
00:01:40,750 --> 00:01:45,530
Forests make up nearly a third of the Earth's land area.

19
00:01:45,530 --> 00:01:51,460
Plants there take in carbon dioxide from the air and produce oxygen.

20
00:01:51,460 --> 00:01:57,750
They also trap harmful things in their leaves and help clean the air.

21
00:01:57,750 --> 00:02:02,510
Therefore, people often call forests the lungs of the Earth.

22
00:02:02,510 --> 00:02:07,800
Each of these ecosystems supports millions of plants and animals.

23
00:02:07,800 --> 00:02:12,520
They keep the planet healthy and make our world a better place.
